# Spider-Woman, Secret Agent: the creature can't become untapped "for as long as you control Spider-Woman" (CR 611.2b). Bot2's
# Swords to Plowshares exiles her after her ability has resolved, and Memnite, tapped by it, untaps in Bot2's untap step.

